# Facts about Grisk.

@fact grisk.lender
tier: surface
text: A goblin moneylender in a velvet waistcoat: sixty crowns today, twelve a month for six months.

@fact grisk.ledger
tier: personal
unlock: met(grisk) and seen(grisk_pleasantries) > 0
text: He calls debts "friendships", and keeps all of them in one ledger he never lets out of reach.

@fact grisk.favours
tier: personal
unlock: seen(grisk_favour) > 0
text: He sometimes asks for favours instead of coin, and the favours are for clients he never names.
